{"code":"E13","wikidata":"Q6633173","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Na BTS station","th":"สถานีบางนา"},"summary":{"en":"Bang Na station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Bang Na District, Bangkok, Thailand. Opened in 2011, it is a part of the Skytrain extension from On Nut to Bearing station. It has a skywalk to the Bangkok International Trade and Exhibition Centre (BITEC).","th":"สถานีบางนา เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอส สายสุขุมวิท ในเขตบางนา เปิดให้บริการในปี พ.ศ."},"opened":"2011-08-12","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/E13_Bang_Na_Station.jpg/960px-E13_Bang_Na_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:E13_Bang_Na_Station.jpg","author":"KrebsLovesFiesh","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Bangkok_BTS_%2831067429086%29.jpg/960px-Bangkok_BTS_%2831067429086%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_BTS_(31067429086).jpg","author":"Edward Russell","license":"CC BY 2.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/BTS_Bang_Na_stn.JPG/960px-BTS_Bang_Na_stn.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Bang_Na_stn.JPG","author":"暇・カキコ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/BTS_E13.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_E13.png","author":"V i P","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Cherprang_BD%2C_Bangkok%2C_2018-06-03_%28001%29.jpg/960px-Cherprang_BD%2C_Bangkok%2C_2018-06-03_%28001%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=th